# Feats language file, generated from the code. Do not edit, copy it to another language instead.
# English, written by ./gradlew generateLang. Feats copies it to lang/Server/Languages/en-US/ in its
# data folder on every start. To translate, copy it to lang/Server/Languages/<language>/feats.lang,
# delete the first line so Feats never replaces your copy, and translate the right hand sides.
# The file name adds feats. to every key, so a key reads chat.label, not feats.chat.label.
# Keep every {placeholder} as it is. A key left out shows in English.

